      "writtenOn": "2018-10-18T09:05:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dialer app uses StatusHints#getIcon and calls Icon#loadDrawable. \n\nDrawable icon \u003d statusHints.getIcon().loadDrawable(context);\n\nIn my understanding, we can\u0027t create Icon object from Drawable object because Drawable is a abstract class and which does not contain resource ID field. Icon object is a drawable description and must have resource ID field.\n\nSo, we need to use StatusHints#getIcon that returns drawable object but it has @Deprecated now. Can we remove @Deprecated and move these implementations into the method?",
      "parentUuid": "d2da6c91_b3783ce4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 110,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 110,
        "endChar": 35
      },
